      "body": "Ahhh you're right. As you pointed out, the behavior changed for backend with default associated element types. These were completely eliminated in #5000 which came after 0.21, but the expected behavior is broken prior to that.\n\nNow the default settings are configured per device (initialized once).\n\nThe intention with default backend element types was never really to have users define different backends just to change the element type for the same program. We could introduce a patch for 0.21 with one of the suggested fixes, even if it is already going to be phased out in the next pre-release.",
